  "rai:dataLimitations": "Coverage is limited to 23 tasks from four benchmark sources and should not be treated as representative of all black-box optimization settings. Results also depend on the assumptions and fidelity of the underlying simulators and surrogate benchmarks.",
  "rai:dataBiases": "The dataset inherits biases from the selected benchmark suites, including their task choices, metrics, and simulator or surrogate assumptions. Benchmark-friendly domains are overrepresented relative to real-world deployment settings. Also, the human baselines are rooted in experiences of a few black-box optimization researchers. It perhaps introduces bias in the task domains and baselines towards their familiar research topics.",
  "rai:personalSensitiveInformation": "No personal or sensitive information is intended to be included.",
  "rai:dataUseCases": "This dataset is designed to benchmark auto-formulation capability for black-box optimization.\nValidated use cases: zero-shot evaluation of large language models (see [TODO]). Not validated for high-stakes operational decision making or use in production systems.",
  "rai:dataSocialImpact": "Potential benefits include improved reproducibility and comparability in optimization research. A main risk is overgeneralizing from benchmark performance to real-world settings.",
